MoodSense – Mood Prediction System

About the Project

MoodSense is a simple Python-based project that predicts whether a sentence expresses a Happy or Sad mood.

Features

- Counts Happy and Sad sentences.
- Predicts mood using clue words.
- Tests the prediction using practice sentences.
- Calculates prediction accuracy.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Text File

Project Files

- "main.py" – Python program
- "train_data.txt" – Training dataset

How to Run

Run the "main.py" file using Python.

Project Level

Beginner Python Project
